      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article describes how involving patients and analysing procedures in a rapid-access chest pain clinic improved the service. Waiting times were reduced, targets were met, processes were improved and a new cardiac rehabilitation service was offered to patients with newly diagnosed angina."},
